error[B0106]: a `@Transparent` struct has exactly one stored property; `Pair` has 2
 --> check/transparent.bloom:6:14
  |
6 |   public let b: String
  |              ^ a second stored property
  |
help: a transparent struct is its one field at run time; make the others computed properties, or drop `@Transparent`
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs

